被锁定的敌人，造成导电伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害。\n\n黄灯·下落攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成导电伤害。\n\n红灯·普攻\n进行最多3段的连续攻击，造成导电伤害。\n\n红灯·重击\n消耗耐力，啾啾和灯灯一同下砸，攻击目标，造成导电伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害。\n\n红灯·下落攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成导电伤害。\n\n红灯·闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，攻击目标，造成导电伤害。","descEn":"Yellow Light: Basic Attack\nSummon Squeakie to shoot three shots in a row, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nYellow Light: Sprint \nDodge to perform Sprint and enter Zoom Mode. Lumi is unable to Dodge when performing Sprint.\n\nYellow Light: Zoom\nWhen in this state, automatically shoot Glitters at a locked-on target and deal Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n\nYellow Light: Plunging Attack\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nRed Light: Basic Attack\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nRed Light: Heavy Attack\nConsume STA to strike the ground with Squeakie, causing an impact dealing Electro DMG, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n\nRed Light: Plunging Attack\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nRed Light: Dodge Counter\nUse Basic Attack right after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.","params":[{"label":"黄灯·普攻","labelEn":"Yellow Light: Basic Attack","values":["16.00%*3","17.32%*3","18.63%*3","20.47%*3","21.78%*3","23.29%*3","25.39%*3","27.48%*3","29.58%*3","31.81%*3"]},{"label":"飞星","labelEn":"Glitter","values":["32.00%","34.63%","37.25%","40.93%","43.55%","46.57%","50.77%","54.96%","59.16%","63.62%"]},{"label":"黄灯·下落攻击","labelEn":"Yellow Light: Plunging Attack","values":["48.00%","51.94%","55.88%","61.39%","65.32%","69.85%","76.15%","82.44%","88.74%","95.43%"]},{"label":"红灯·普攻一段伤害","labelEn":"Red Light: Basic Attack 1 DMG","values":["45.60%","49.34%","53.08%","58.32%","62.06%","66.36%","72.34%","78.32%","84.31%","90.66%"]},{"label":"红灯·普攻二段伤害","labelEn":"Red Light: Basic Attack 2 DMG","values":["54.15%+10.83%*5","58.60%+11.72%*5","63.04%+12.61%*5","69.25%+13.85%*5","73.69%+14.74%*5","78.80%+15.76%*5","85.90%+17.18%*5","93.01%+18.61%*5","100.11%+